\u00af(inflation). The index\u00e2\u20ac\u00afmeasures\u00e2\u20ac\u00afprice changes\u00e2\u20ac\u00afin relation to\u00e2\u20ac\u00afa\u00e2\u20ac\u00afbase year.\u00e2\u20ac\u00afData are\u00e2\u20ac\u00afavailable\u00e2\u20ac\u00afwith 2 decimals for the aggregates and\u00e2\u20ac\u00af1 or 2 decimals for countries.</p><p>Please note that this dataset is discontinued and replaced by dataset <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/60ebcdf2-9eb8-4901-b98e-46b62b318ea4?lang=en&amp;createdAt=2026-05-20T13:19:44Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">prc_hicp_minr</a></p>","id":"PRC_HICP_MIDX","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_MIDX","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"108.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2015-11-16T10:18:07+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_MIDX\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_MIDX</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2023-01-19</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf","text":"Information note"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.e